# [FINDINGS] B0: format_design §2.5's GENERAL fragment rule, on a line that
# is not `analysis` — a file-level `description` in an included fragment is
# refused at the ENTRY's parse, naming the fragment's own line. The
# `analysis` case is `analysis_in_fragment.rxtin`; together they are the
# rule's two refusal classes (a bundle, any other head line). Leg A only.
include "fragment_head_line_frag.rxtfrag"

pattern top
m "top" 0 3
